msgstr "Plus d'outils gratuits de Wbcom Designs"

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:94
msgid ""
"Favorite Notification keeps members coming back when their activity gets "
"liked. These free Wbcom Designs plugins give them more worth coming back "
"to: the theme and network itself, forums, media, events, gamification, "
"directories, jobs, courses, and services."
